  <data name="Overview_Title.Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>Civ VI Toolkit</value></data>
  <data name="Overview_Subtitle.Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>用于游戏识别、单机修改、存档、Mod 与启动流程的模块化 Civilization VI 工具箱。</value></data>
  <data name="Overview_StatusScanning.Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>正在扫描 Civilization VI…</value></data>
  <data name="Overview_StatusDetecting.Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>正在识别 Steam / Epic Games 与 DX11 / DX12</value></data>
